{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented percentage and fixed-amount promos for orders and subscription upgrades. Both paths use one pricing helper to check eligibility, apply the discount, and calculate tax on the discounted subtotal. Percentage discounts round half-up to the nearest cent. For upgrades, the minimum spend and discount apply to the prorated charge.\n\nOrders record the promo code and actual discount. Upgrade retries return the original entry when all arguments match. Changing `promo_code` or `as_of` under the same idempotency key raises `ValidationError`.\n\nAdded five promo tests covering registration, rounding, discount caps, expiry, stacking, minimum spend, and upgrade retries. `run_checks.py` passed all 15 tests and exited 0."}}
